ilir.</p><p>Haftalık çalışma süresi yaklaşık 10 saattir. Haftalık yönlendirilen maksimum danışan sayısı 20 kişidir.</p><p></p><p>Eğitim programı ve çalışma modülleri hakkında tüm detaylar başvuru yapan adaylarla paylaşılacaktır.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>", "publishedAt": "2026-09-21T06:06:14.305Z", "currencyCode": "TRY", "positionLevel": "SPECIALIST", "professionIds": ["01a04336-d50b-771d-85ef-c6361db2507f", "01a04336-d507-747d-b14a-03a697a80edd", "01a04336-d50b-771d-85f0-3cfea6fd6b0c"], "isConfidential": false, "advertisementId": "01a0b329-5987-7ae5-be11-1cb046ca30fd", "isMostPreferred": false, "statusUpdatedAt": "2026-09-21T06:06:14.305Z", "companyShortName": "SYNAPSE LYNK DANISMA", "locationSourceType": "Branch", "advertisementNumber": "1000355", "advertisementStatus": "Approved", "advertisementJobType": "FullTime", "advertisementModeOfOperation": "Remote", "advertisementRecruitmentProcess": {"id": "01a0b325-f075-720c-b9e4-24c8d56af8e4", "data": {"edges": [{"id": "edge-fast-0", "type": "smoothstep", "source": "node-fast-0", "target": "node-fast-1"}, {"id": "edge-fast-1", "type": "smoothstep", "source": "node-fast-1", "target": "node-fast-2"}], "nodes": [{"id": "node-placeholder-fast", "data": {"label": "Hızlı İşe Alım", "description": "CV → Telefon Görüşmesi → Teklif", "_isPlaceholder": true}, "type": "processStep", "position": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}, {"id": "node-fast-0", "data": {"icon": "📄", "name": "CV İnceleme", "color": "#1f3a93", "label": "CV İnceleme"}, "type": "0d3a00ff-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "label": "CV İnceleme", "position": {"x": 320, "y": 80}}, {"id": "node-fast-1", "data": {"icon": "📞", "name": "Telefon Görüşmesi", "color": "#0ea5a4", "label": "Telefon Görüşmesi"}, "type": "0d3a00ff-0000-4000-8000-000000000002", "label": "Telefon Görüşmesi", "position": {"x": 320, "y": 230}}, {"id": "node-fast-2", "data": {"icon": "🎉", "name": "Teklif", "color": "#157347", "label": "Teklif"}, "type": "0d3a00ff-0000-4000-8000-000000000006", "label": "Teklif"